  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ya está listo el sistema de búsqueda especial!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100590061002000650073007400E10020006C006900730074006F00200065006C002000730069007300740065006D00610020006400650020006200FA00730071007500650064006100200065007300700065006300690061006C002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Especial por qué?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0045007300700065006300690061006C00200070006F007200200071007500E9003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Y qué busca?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005900200071007500E9002000620075007300630061003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A ver. Todavía siguen apareciendo distorsiones,\nasí que Luminalia Dimensional sigue estando ahí.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y seguro que aún quedan muchos puntos que\nexplorar en esa dimensión!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10059002000730065006700750072006F00200071007500650020006100FA006E002000710075006500640061006E0020006D007500630068006F0073002000700075006E0074006F00730020007100750065000A006500780070006C006F00720061007200200065006E0020006500730061002000640069006D0065006E0073006900F3006E002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero para eso hace falta algo que nos ayude a\nlocalizarlos. Y lo tenemos. Se llama...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡El sistema de <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>búsqueda especial<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Al decirlo así, parece como si lo hubiera hecho yo,\npero en realidad es obra de Quastelar S. A.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Este sistema permite localizar las distorsiones\nespeciales que llevan a zonas inexploradas<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde Luminalia Dimensional.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero, para poder utilizarlo, primero hace falta\navanzar en la investigación dimensional.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAsí que ya sabes lo que te toca hacer.\n¡Buena suerte y a completar tareas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 171
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si quieres usar el sistema de búsqueda especial,\nya sabes: ¡a completar tareas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Buen trabajo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750065006E002000740072006100620061006A006F002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Veo que completaste sin problemas\nel encargo del señor Corax.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560065006F002000710075006500200063006F006D0070006C006500740061007300740065002000730069006E002000700072006F0062006C0065006D00610073000A0065006C00200065006E0063006100720067006F002000640065006C00200073006500F1006F007200200043006F007200610078002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te invito a visitarlo en su oficina.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006500200069006E007600690074006F0020006100200076006900730069007400610072006C006F00200065006E0020007300750020006F0066006900630069006E0061002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Excelente!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045007800630065006C0065006E00740065002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora ingreso los datos que recopilaste...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068006F0072006100200069006E0067007200650073006F0020006C006F00730020006400610074006F007300200071007500650020007200650063006F00700069006C0061007300740065002E002E002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y bingo! ¡El sistema de búsqueda especial ya\nestá listo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10059002000620069006E0067006F0021002000A10045006C002000730069007300740065006D00610020006400650020006200FA00730071007500650064006100200065007300700065006300690061006C002000790061000A00650073007400E10020006C006900730074006F002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se llama así porque sirve para buscar, ¡y lo que\nencuentra son distorsiones especiales!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Habla conmigo cuando quieras que active\nel sistema de búsqueda especial.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Impresionante!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10049006D00700072006500730069006F006E0061006E00740065002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Existe una alta probabilidad de encontrar\nPokémon especiales en las zonas descubiertas<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npor el sistema!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo malo es que hay que ingresar datos nuevos\ncada vez que se usa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F0020006D0061006C006F00200065007300200071007500650020006800610079002000710075006500200069006E0067007200650073006100720020006400610074006F00730020006E007500650076006F0073000A0063006100640061002000760065007A00200071007500650020007300650020007500730061002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí, lo sé, es engorroso. ¡Pero para ti será pan\ncomido!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300ED002C0020006C006F0020007300E9002C00200065007300200065006E0067006F00720072006F0073006F002E002000A1005000650072006F00200070006100720061002000740069002000730065007200E1002000700061006E000A0063006F006D00690064006F002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Para poder usar la búsqueda especial necesitas\npuntos de investigación dimensional.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Corax te pidió que vayas a su oficina.\n¡Ve a la Sede del Clan Corrosión!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3576,
